          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ mbee wa mĩthenya ĩsu kũtyaĩ ĩtuvĩ ya mũndũ kana ĩtuvi ya nyamũ; o na kũtyaĩ mũuo kwa ũla waumaalile kana ũla walikile, nũndũ wa nthũ: nũndũ nĩngũmaingĩanĩsya andũ onthe kĩla ũmwe na mũtũi wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ yu kwa ũtialo wa andũ aa ndikethĩwa ta mĩthenya ya tene, easya ũu Yeova wa nguthu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nũndũ kũkeethĩwa ũsyao wa mũuo; mũsavivũ ũkasyaa ũsyao waw’o, na nthĩ ĩkaingĩvasya ũsyao wayo, na matu makaete ĩmwe yamo; na ngatuma ũtialo wa andũ aa ũtiĩwa maũndũ aa onthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
